black room chimes hourly, halting the revelry and instilling dread, until a mysterious figure dressed as the Red Death, drenched in blood and wearing a corpse-like mask, appears and walks deliberately through all seven rooms. Enraged, Prince Prospero pursues the figure with a dagger, but when he confronts it in the black chamber, he collapses dead; the courtiers rush in only to discover the mask and robes are empty, revealing the Red Death itself has infiltrated their sanctuary, and one by one, all revelers die as the clock stops and darkness claims the abbey.</div>\\n                \\n                \\n                <div class=\\\"chapter-characters\\\" style=\\\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\\\">\\n                    <strong style=\\\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\\\">Characters:</strong>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Prince Prospero</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Courtiers</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Musicians</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Buffoons</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Improvisatori</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Ballet-dancers</span>\\n                    \\n                    <span class=\\\"tag\\\">Beauty</span>\\n                    \\n                    \\n                </div>\\n                \\n            </div>\\n            \\n        </section>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div id=\\\"characters\\\" class=\\\"tab-content\\\">\\n        <section>\\n            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\\n\\n            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\\\">\\n                <label style=\\\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;